  - 'Not built yet. Here will be The lame smith''s bough on the Great Hammer''s Way, the weapon tree: taking Metal from its god opens it and gives The Smith''s Hammer. Neither the weapon nor its moves are made yet. The lame smith is not built yet either. The Way arrives in phase 5 of the playtest.'
